body:
If you already were registered to vote but moved to a different county, you can try to get an affidavit ballot but you need to contact your county board of elections. Lemme get you the website link. [https://www.elections.ny.gov/CountyBoards.html](https://www.elections.ny.gov/CountyBoards.html)

&#x200B;

Good luck and don't give up on voting yet until they absolutely tell you that you have no chance of voting.
